{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",

  "model": "opencode/deepseek-v4-flash-free",
  "default_agent": "build",
  "shell": "bash",

  "permission": {
    "read": "allow",
    "glob": "allow",
    "grep": "allow",
    "edit": "ask",
    "bash": {
      "*": "ask",
      "xmake *": "allow",
      "xmake f *": "allow",
      "xmake config *": "allow",
      "scripts/*": "allow",
      "gdb *": "allow",
      "g++ *": "allow",
      "cppcheck *": "allow",
      "clang-tidy *": "allow",
      "clang-tidy-18 *": "allow",
      "clang-format *": "allow",
      "clang-format-18 *": "allow",
      "git status *": "allow",
      "git diff *": "allow",
      "git log *": "allow",
      "git add *": "allow",
      "git commit *": "ask",
      "git push *": "ask",
      "curl *": "allow"
    },
    "webfetch": "allow",
    "websearch": "ask",
    "question": "allow",
    "todowrite": "allow"
  },

  "agent": {
    "build": {
      "permission": {
        "edit": "ask",
        "bash": {
          "*": "ask",
          "xmake *": "allow",
          "scripts/*": "allow",
          "gdb *": "allow",
          "clang-tidy *": "allow",
          "clang-tidy-18 *": "allow",
          "cppcheck *": "allow",
          "clang-format *": "allow",
          "clang-format-18 *": "allow",
          "g++ *": "allow",
          "git status *": "allow",
          "git diff *": "allow",
          "git log *": "allow",
          "git add *": "allow",
          "git commit *": "ask"
        }
      }
    },
    "plan": {
      "permission": {
        "edit": "deny",
        "bash": "deny"
      }
    }
  },

  "command": {
    "build": {
      "template": "Run `xmake` to build the project. If compilation errors occur, analyze them and fix the code, then rebuild until successful.",
      "description": "编译项目",
      "agent": "build"
    },
    "run": {
      "template": "Run `xmake run $ARGUMENTS` to execute the project.",
      "description": "运行项目",
      "agent": "build"
    },
    "test": {
      "template": "Run `xmake test` to execute all Google Test tests. Report results. If any tests fail, analyze the failures, fix the code, and re-run until all pass.",
      "description": "运行测试",
      "agent": "build"
    },
    "clean": {
      "template": "Run `xmake clean && xmake f -c` to clean all build artifacts.",
      "description": "清理构建产物",
      "agent": "build"
    },
    "debug": {
      "template": "Run the project with GDB using `xmake run -d`. If a specific target is specified as argument, debug that target.",
      "description": "GDB 调试",
      "agent": "build"
    },
    "format": {
      "template": "Run clang-format on all source files (src/**/*.cpp, src/**/*.hpp, include/**/*.hpp, tests/**/*.cpp) to enforce code style.",
      "description": "格式化代码",
      "agent": "build"
    },
    "review": {
      "template": "Review current code changes. If this is a git repository, use `git diff` to find uncommitted changes. If not a git repository, scan all source files in src/ and include/ directories. Check for bugs, security issues, and code quality problems. Do NOT modify any code. Output a Chinese report organized by severity.",
      "description": "审查代码变更",
      "agent": "plan"
    },
    "add-target": {
      "template": "If $ARGUMENTS is empty, ask the user for the target name first. Then add a new xmake target named <name> to xmake.lua. Create the required source file directory structure (src/<name>/*.cpp and tests/test_<name>.cpp).",
      "description": "添加 xmake 目标",
      "agent": "build"
    },
     "env-check": {
        "template": "Run a comprehensive environment check:\n1. g++ --version\n2. xmake --version\n3. cppcheck --version\n4. clang-tidy --version\n5. gdb --version\n6. If $CODEQL_SERVER_URL is set, curl it to verify; otherwise try http://localhost:8080; if that fails, ask user for CodeQL server IP\n\nOutput a Chinese table showing each tool's status (✅/❌).",
       "description": "检测开发环境",
       "agent": "build"
    },
     "check": {
        "template": "Run code quality checks.\n\n**Phase 1 — Pre-compile:**\n1. clang-tidy on all source files\n2. cppcheck --enable=all --suppress=unusedFunction\n3. Strict gate: 0 error + 0 warning + 0 style + 0 performance\n\n**Phase 2 — CodeQL Post-build:**\n1. If $CODEQL_SERVER_URL is already set, use it directly; go to step 4\n2. Otherwise, try default: http://localhost:8080 — curl to check connectivity\n3. If connection fails, ask user: '请输入 CodeQL 服务器 IP（端口固定 8080）' and retry until success or cancel\n4. Generate compile_commands.json: xmake project -k compile_commands\n5. Fix compile_commands.json: filter external deps (absolute paths like /usr/...), set directory='.', convert backslashes to forward slashes\n6. Create tar.gz source archive (include src/ tests/ xmake.lua, exclude *.o *.obj *.exe .xmake/ build/)\n7. curl -X POST $CODEQL_SERVER_URL/analyze -F 'source=@source.tar.gz' -F 'compile_commands=@fixed.json'\n8. Parse SARIF response, check invocations[0].executionSuccessful\n9. Report issues with ruleId, severity, file/line, message\n10. Strict gate: 0 critical + 0 high severity\n\nOutput Chinese quality report with pass/fail per phase.",
       "description": "代码质量检查",
       "agent": "build"
    },
    "dev": {
       "template": "Start the full development pipeline. Requirement: $ARGUMENTS\n\nFollow this pipeline strictly. Pause at each step for user approval.\n\n**Step 0: Requirements Analysis**\n- Break down requirement into function points\n- Define interface signatures\n- Identify files and targets to create/modify\n- List test cases\n- Output Chinese requirements analysis report (include: background, requirements breakdown, proposed approach, unclear items, completion criteria)\n- PAUSE for user review and approval\n- If user requests changes, revise the report and re-present until approved\n\n**Step 1: Requirements Refinement**\n- Break down requirement into function points\n- Define interface signatures\n- Identify files and targets to create/modify\n- List test cases\n- Output Chinese requirements document\n- PAUSE for user approval\n\n**Step 2: Coding**\n- Create/modify files per AGENTS.md conventions\n- Write Google Test unit tests\n- Update xmake.lua if needed\n- PAUSE for user approval\n\n**Step 3: Pre-compile Quality Check (LOOP if fail)**\n- clang-tidy + cppcheck\n- Strict gate: 0 error + 0 warning + 0 style\n\n**Step 4: Compilation (LOOP if fail)**\n- xmake\n- xmake project -k compile_commands\n\n**Step 5: CodeQL Post-build**\n1. If $CODEQL_SERVER_URL is already set, use it directly; go to step 6\n2. Otherwise, try default: http://localhost:8080 — curl to check connectivity\n3. If connection fails, ask user: '请输入 CodeQL 服务器 IP（端口固定 8080）' and retry\n4. Repeat step 3 until connection succeeds or user cancels\n5. Set $CODEQL_SERVER_URL with confirmed IP\n6. Fix compile_commands.json: filter external deps (absolute paths like /usr/...), set directory='.', convert \\ to /\n7. Create tar.gz source archive (include src/ tests/ xmake.lua, exclude *.o *.obj *.exe .xmake/ build/)\n8. curl -X POST $CODEQL_SERVER_URL/analyze -F 'source=@source.tar.gz' -F 'compile_commands=@fixed.json'\n9. Parse SARIF response, check invocations[0].executionSuccessful\n10. Report issues with ruleId, severity, file/line, message\n11. Strict gate: 0 critical + 0 high severity\n12. If issues found \u2192 fix \u2192 go to Step 3 (LOOP)\n\n**Step 6: Testing (LOOP if fail)**\n- xmake test\n\n**Step 7: Summary Report**\n- Feature list, quality summary, test results, git diff\n\nUse Chinese throughout.",
       "description": "一键开发流水线",
       "agent": "build"
    }
  },

  "formatter": {
    "clang-format": {
      "command": ["clang-format", "-i", "$FILE"],
      "extensions": [".cpp", ".hpp", ".h", ".cc", ".cxx"]
    }
  },

  "lsp": true,

  "instructions": ["AGENTS.md"],

  "watcher": {
    "ignore": ["build/**", ".xmake/**", ".git/**", "node_modules/**", "scripts/**"]
  },

  "compaction": {
    "auto": true,
    "reserved": 10000
  },

  "share": "manual"
}
